{"id":"6af93bac45e6f88d","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-quasivariety-hspp.md","title":"thm-quasivariety-hspp","display":"thm-quasivariety-hspp","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-quasivariety]]","[[93-df-closure-operators]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"],"display":"thm-quasivariety-hspp","label":"93-thm-quasivariety-hspp","aliases":["93-thm-quasivariety-hspp"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"14fa67446efa83b1\" href=\"?note=14fa67446efa83b1\" title=\"93-df-quasivariety\">93-df-quasivariety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-quasivariety-hspp"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-quasivariety-hspp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-quasivariety-hspp</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-quasivariety-hspp-thm-quasivariety-hspp\">thm-quasivariety-hspp <code>thm-quasivariety-hspp</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span> is the generated-quasivariety constructor of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14fa67446efa83b1\" href=\"?note=14fa67446efa83b1\" title=\"93-df-quasivariety\">93-df-quasivariety</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U}\">\\(\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U}\\)</span> is closure under isomorphic copies, subalgebras, direct products, and ultraproducts as defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}quasivariety\\text{-}hspp}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\n\\to\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)=\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}quasivariety\\text{-}hspp}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\n\\to\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)=\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Arbitrary homomorphic images do not preserve quasi-identities, so the legacy mnemonic ``hspp'' must not be read as containing the operator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm H\">\\(\\mathrm H\\)</span>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-quasivariety-hspp-thm-quasivariety-hspp","text":"thm-quasivariety-hspp `thm-quasivariety-hspp`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-quasivariety","status":"resolved","id":"14fa67446efa83b1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-quasivariety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-closure-operators","status":"resolved","id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-closure-operators]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quasivariety","status":"resolved","id":"14fa67446efa83b1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}$ is the generated-quasivariety constructor of [[93-df-quasivariety]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-closure-operators","status":"resolved","id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U}$ is closure under isomorphic copies, subalgebras, direct products, and ultraproducts as defined in [[93-df-closure-operators]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}quasivariety\\text{-}hspp}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\n\\to\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)=\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm H","display":false}],"bytes":1108,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["14fa67446efa83b1","97b46a497e251f9f","ee84ed8b0fae5bc3"]}